# OPTION 1: BREVO REST API (RECOMMENDED - 100% Firewall-Proof over HTTPS Port 443)
# 1. Sign up at https://www.brevo.com/ (300 free emails/day, no credit card required)
# 2. Go to SMTP & API -> API Keys -> Generate a new API Key
# 3. Paste key below:
BREVO_API_KEY=xkeysib-your-brevo-api-key
CONTACT_RECEIVER_EMAIL=urvagandhi24@gmail.com

